      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, that code is self-contained though (a call to the external crate `zeroize` and a loop issuing `DC` instructions) it would be trivial to move that to the external library I\u0027m suggesting we introduce.\n\nI\u0027d rather duplicate a fundamental function like this between `lib_open_dice_clear_memory_baremetal` and `vmbase` (if it still needs it?) than `DiceClearMemory` between `pvmfw`, Rialto, and any other `vmbase` client using DICE; WDYT?",
